{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, grab it, check properties, do task, and move; else, approach object or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToInitialPosition    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoTaskWithObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
